# Release compatibility

Choose the documentation release that matches the Upwell application you are maintaining. The release picker changes both the available guides and their routes.

Upwell 0.20 guides preserve the published pre-1.0 application forms. Upwell 1.0 guides describe the current application model. Read the migration guide before applying 1.0 examples to a 0.20 application.
